WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.232
A limited view can reduce the columns and rows exposed through that interface.

00:00:06.232 --> 00:00:11.337
That is useful. But it does not by itself guarantee that users cannot access the base table.

00:00:11.337 --> 00:00:17.617
It does not replace grants, row level security, or broader compliance controls.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:21.369
Use precise language about what the view actually protects.
